        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Holiday World & Splashin' Safari, Santa Claus, Indiana\n- Products: The Voyage\n- Concepts: Wooden roller coasters\n- Topics: Theme park sections\n\nFacts:\n- Holiday World & Splashin' Safari is a theme park in Santa Claus, Indiana.\n- Holiday World & Splashin' Safari is divided into four sections themed to Christmas, Halloween, Thanksgiving, and the Fourth of July.\n- The Voyage is a wooden roller coaster located at Holiday World & Splashin' Safari.\n- The Voyage is an example of a wooden roller coaster with a steel support structure.\n- The Voyage features three separate 90-degree banked turns.",
